WEBVTT

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:09.931
It took us all spring
to build that summer habitat!
我们花了整整一个春天
才建成那个夏季栖息地

00:00:10.015 --> 00:00:11.057
All spring!
整整一个春天

00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:13.268
[Manny] And you destroyed it in seconds!
而你们几秒钟就把它毁了

00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:14.686
Whoo! That's a new record.
这可是新纪录呀

00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:17.647
It took us, like, eight minutes
to destroy our fall habitat.
当初毁掉秋季栖息地
我们可是花了8分钟呢

00:00:17.731 --> 00:00:20.817
But why'd you build it
right in the middle of our ice-alanche?
你为什么把栖息地
建在我们的冰崩范围里呢？

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.193
Rookie error, dude.
菜鸟级的错误 哥们

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:23.445
[groans]

00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:26.031
Diego! They're all yours.
迪亚哥 他们俩归你了

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.200
-About time.
-[both gasp]
总算等到了

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:32.787
[laughs, blows raspberry]

00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:35.832
Oh, great. Now I have rabies.
好极了 这下我得狂犬病了

00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:38.960
Okay, okay.
Let's work this out like a family.
好啦 我们来像一家人一样解决问题

00:00:39.044 --> 00:00:43.340
Manny, use your feeling words. "I feel…"
曼尼 用表达感受的词汇 “我感觉…”

00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:45.925
Come on. "I feel…"
来啊 “我感觉…”

00:00:46.509 --> 00:00:50.388
I feel like I'm about to crush you
like a grape.
我感觉我想像碾葡萄一样把你碾碎

00:00:50.472 --> 00:00:52.515
That's good. Breakthrough!
很好 这是很大的进步

00:00:52.599 --> 00:00:54.893
Okay, look, it was an accident.
行了 这是个意外

00:00:54.976 --> 00:00:56.978
Let's just try to find
a new place to sleep
我们得另外找个地方过夜

00:00:57.062 --> 00:00:59.147
and you can yell at 'em in the morning.
你明早再对他们嚷嚷也不迟

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.815
[scoffs] I might as well yell at rocks.
我还不如去对着石头嚷嚷呢

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:04.277
If it wasn't for her protection,
you two would've been gone long ago.
要不是有她护着 你们俩早就完蛋了

00:01:04.361 --> 00:01:09.199
Ha! If it wasn't for her,
we'd be out there in the world a-roaming.
要不是因为她
我们早就去外面的世界游历了

00:01:09.282 --> 00:01:11.534
Yeah! Our a-roaming skills are strong.
就是！我们外出游历的能力可强了

00:01:11.618 --> 00:01:15.538
No, your aroma is strong.
You'd never survive on your own.
不 你们的体味那才叫强
你们根本没法独立生存下去

00:01:15.622 --> 00:01:18.249
-We could if we wanted.
-Yeah-- Oh, yeah?
-只要我们想 我们就能
-真的吗

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:21.336
-I double-dog dare you to prove it.
-Manny, stop egging them on.
-那就证明给我看呀
-曼尼 你别撺掇他们

00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:25.006
Well, I'm just saying, maybe they've
reached a point in their lives
我只是随便说说 或许他们已经到了

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.300
where they're ready to get out of my hair.
可以让我清静清静的时候

00:01:27.384 --> 00:01:33.348
I-- I mean, you know,
go find their own destiny. Huh?
去寻找属于他们自己的人生

00:01:33.431 --> 00:01:35.767
-Nobody's going anywhere!
-Why not?
-谁都不许离开
-为什么

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:39.354
Because you can't
do anything for yourselves.
因为你们自己什么事都做不好

00:01:39.437 --> 00:01:42.732
Anything you can do,
we can do nearly almost as well.
你能做到的事
我们也能做得几乎差不多一样好

00:01:42.816 --> 00:01:44.776
Can you clean your own habitat?
你们能打扫自己的栖息地吗

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.070
Can you feed yourselves?
自己找东西吃？

00:01:47.153 --> 00:01:49.364
Can you protect yourself from predators?
保护自己不被猛兽吃掉？

00:01:50.115 --> 00:01:53.952
Oh, sure, bring those things up.
We do things that matter.
行啊 尽说些有的没的
我们做的可都是大事

00:01:54.452 --> 00:01:55.537
Like this.
比如这个

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.998
[beatboxing]

00:02:03.336 --> 00:02:04.838
The offense rests.
攻方表演完毕

00:02:04.921 --> 00:02:08.925
You know, even though you're my brothers,
sometimes I wish
虽然你们是我的兄弟 但我有时也希望

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:12.846
you were a little more mammoth
and a little less possum.
你们能多几分猛犸作风
少几分负鼠作风

00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:18.852
She just insulted our possum-ness.
她刚侮辱了我们作为负鼠的尊严

00:02:18.935 --> 00:02:22.272
Which is a very big part of who we are.
这是我们的重要特性

00:02:22.355 --> 00:02:25.734
That does it!
I'm done being treated like a baby.
我受够了 不想再被当成小孩子了

00:02:25.817 --> 00:02:29.446
It's time for us to move out
and make our mark on the world!
是时候搬出去了 要获得成功 留名于世

00:02:29.529 --> 00:02:31.740
I make my mark on the world every day.
我天天都在世上留名的

00:02:31.823 --> 00:02:35.285
I just lift my leg and do it.
That tree is mine, for instance.
我就抬腿做个标记 比如那棵树就是我的

00:02:35.368 --> 00:02:37.203
And that tree, and that one.
还有那棵树 还有那棵

00:02:37.996 --> 00:02:40.874
[Eddie] And that rock over there.
And your pillow too!
还有那边那块石头 还有你的枕头

00:02:43.335 --> 00:02:46.796
[snoring]

00:02:48.131 --> 00:02:49.632
[yawns]

00:02:53.053 --> 00:02:54.220
Go sleep over there.
去那边睡去

00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:56.931
And turn on your side
so you don't keep me up snoring all night.
要侧睡 不然整晚打呼 吵得我睡不着

00:02:57.015 --> 00:02:58.350
I-- I don't snore.
我才不打呼

00:02:58.433 --> 00:03:01.394
Trust me,
you blow that face tuba all night long.
相信我 你那喇叭能吹整整一晚上

00:03:01.478 --> 00:03:06.274
Yeah, oh-- Okay, look, I'm sorry
about what I said to Crash and Eddie.
好吧 对不起
我不该对克拉什和埃迪说那种话

00:03:06.358 --> 00:03:09.527
It's just-- Well, family can be difficult.
只是…家人有时也会难相处

00:03:10.028 --> 00:03:13.865
We are a nutty, mixed-up herd
full of loners and outcasts.
我们这一大家子
都是些糊涂又秀逗的独行侠和弃儿

00:03:14.491 --> 00:03:16.493
And that's just on my side.
这还只是我这边

00:03:16.576 --> 00:03:19.788
Right, and you don't hear me
complain about your side ever.
对哦 我怎么就从来不抱怨你家的人呢

00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:21.915
My side takes care of themselves.
我家的人能自己照顾好自己

00:03:23.291 --> 00:03:24.834
Yeah, well, Diego does.
迪亚哥可以

00:03:26.419 --> 00:03:28.338
And then we both take care of Sid.
然后我们俩一起照顾希德

00:03:28.838 --> 00:03:32.342
Nah, don't you gotta--
You've gotta save some for later though.
不 你得…你得留点以后再用

00:03:32.425 --> 00:03:35.095
Well, possum families
just aren't like that.
可负鼠家庭不是那样的

00:03:35.178 --> 00:03:40.642
Yeah, you know, you could let them
face consequences sometimes. Just saying.
对 但你偶尔也可以
让他们自己承担一下后果 我就随便说说

00:03:40.725 --> 00:03:44.896
How? By kicking them out?
You know they can't survive on their own.
你要我怎么做 把他们扫地出门？
你知道他们无法独立生存

00:03:44.979 --> 00:03:46.606
Mmm. Interesting.
有意思

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:49.776
Well, maybe what scares you
is that they won't need you anymore.
或许让你害怕的是
他们有朝一日不再需要你了

00:03:49.859 --> 00:03:54.114
Or maybe it's the fact that their
only natural defense is to play dead.
又或者我怕的是
他们唯一的自保方式就是装死

00:03:55.031 --> 00:03:56.324
They're my brothers.
他们是我的兄弟

00:03:56.408 --> 00:03:59.077
They're the only family I had before you.
在遇见你之前 他们就是我唯一的家人

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.204
They saved my life, Manny.
他们救了我的命 曼尼

00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:06.918
[trumpets]

00:04:16.761 --> 00:04:18.346
[chittering]

00:04:24.519 --> 00:04:26.938
[giggles]

00:04:27.022 --> 00:04:29.357
[Ellie] Mama Possum raised me
as one of her own.
负鼠妈妈把我当成亲生孩子一样抚养

00:04:29.983 --> 00:04:31.818
I was never happier.
我从没那么开心过

00:04:35.947 --> 00:04:37.574
[laughs]

00:04:37.657 --> 00:04:38.658
[groans]

00:04:38.742 --> 00:04:40.994
-[bird screeches]
-[gasps, groans]

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.125
[thuds]

00:04:53.506 --> 00:04:55.967
[laughter]

00:04:56.051 --> 00:04:58.720
[Ellie] I finally felt like I was home.
我终于感受到了家的温暖

00:04:58.803 --> 00:05:00.221
[giggles]

00:05:00.305 --> 00:05:03.266
[both scream]

00:05:05.518 --> 00:05:08.021
[laughter]

00:05:08.104 --> 00:05:09.272
Aw…

00:05:14.444 --> 00:05:17.697
[Ellie] And when we lost her,
I was heartbroken.
当妈妈走时 我的心都碎了

00:05:18.198 --> 00:05:21.868
But I knew my brothers and I
would always have each other.
但我知道我和我的兄弟们
永远可以相互依靠

00:05:24.537 --> 00:05:28.333
Well, Sis, I guess
you're the head possum of the family now.
老姐 现在你是一家之主了

00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:29.542
[sighs]

00:05:45.475 --> 00:05:48.144
You know, I lost my mama too.
我也失去了我的母亲

00:05:49.104 --> 00:05:51.981
Well, technically, she moved away
without leaving a forwarding address.
确切说来 是她没留新地址就直接搬走了

00:05:52.065 --> 00:05:53.441
But then I found Manny here.
但后来我遇到了曼尼

00:05:53.525 --> 00:05:56.152
And then, when Diego came along
and tried to kill us,
再后来 当迪亚哥出现 想杀死我们的时候

00:05:56.236 --> 00:05:58.279
we knew we were destined to be a family.
我们就知道 我们注定要成为一家人

00:05:58.822 --> 00:06:01.241
Sid, don't you have somewhere else
to sleep?
希德 劳驾你去别处睡行吗

00:06:01.324 --> 00:06:02.701
Don't you?
也劳驾你

00:06:03.702 --> 00:06:05.036
[groans]

00:06:17.382 --> 00:06:18.591
[clears throat]

00:06:24.097 --> 00:06:25.557
[yawns]

